[statement]
As `conditions-a-name-completes-are-taken-in-name-order`, with conditions
that hold once `n` is installed, and `qb` in place of `rb`: apk installs
`ra`, which its name table holds before `qb`
(`install-order/packages-one-placement-triggers-in-apk-s-table-order`),
and with it `lo`, the one candidate for its dependency `Y`; `lo` answers
`X`, which `qb` needs, and `hi` is not installed.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:n w v

P:n
V:1

P:qb
V:1
i:n
D:X

P:ra
V:1
i:n
D:Y

P:hi
V:1
k:100
p:X

P:lo
V:1
p:X Y=1

P:w
V:1
D:X

P:v
V:1
D:Y

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install n 1
install lo 1
install ra 1
install qb 1
